                    "edge " + from + " -> " + to + " is not in the graph");
        }
    }

    @Nested
    @DisplayName("hasCycle")
    class HasCycle {

        @Test
        @DisplayName("reports a cycle in a graph that loops back")
        void detectsCycle() {
            DirectedGraph graph = DirectedGraph.from(4, new int[][] {
                {0, 1}, {1, 2}, {2, 0}, {2, 3}
            });
            assertTrue(detector.hasCycle(graph));
        }

